{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BtT2JXNBn6PzjPKDRV4ATq","type":"tool_result","content":"--- d446d2b ---\nd446d2b bench: per-arm JIT warmup (ds4-vllm two-request protocol) + MTP intel notes\ncommit d446d2b3f69a35c2eb91fa1ad36f27c2571d1aeb\nAuthor: mecattaf <thomas@mecattaf.dev>\nDate:   Sun Aug 30 12:36:45 2026 +0200\n\n    bench: per-arm JIT warmup (ds4-vllm two-request protocol) + MTP intel notes\n    \n    warmup_arm() after each arm's readiness: a tiny completion compiles the\n    Triton decode/drafter kernels, then one max-depth prefill walks every\n    indexer depth bucket on the way up (ds4-vllm-warmup.py's insight — no\n    per-depth sweep). Without it the first measured load of each cell pays\n    multi-minute JIT stalls. Unique nonce prompt so no measured cell can hit\n    warmup-seeded cache. DAYRUN-NOTES: ds4-vllm deep-dive corrections and\n    transferables (DS4_MTP_STATS/bench driver not published; MoE fast-path\n    bound is n_rows*experts<=64 branch-only; stash contract et al).\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RZLdMFrCnEgtaWKRfxfWWP\n\n bench/run-matrix.sh     | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n handoff/DAYRUN-NOTES.md | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 61 insertions(+)\n--- prev rev-4 commit stat ---\ncommit 69053ad9be6ed49c1a0a55483d152899d07a1935\nAuthor: tally spec-build <tally-spec-build@invalid>\nDate:   Sun Aug 30 12:24:54 2026 +0200\n\n    instruments: Engagement-proof instruments adapted into the container overlay (rev 4: carrier for proxy first-light fixes 8669bad)\n    \n    Rejected the lane-tip commit message and used the task-id template instead. Reason: type must be one of build, chore, ci, docs, feat, fix, perf, refactor, revert, style, test.\n    \n    Tally-Task: instruments\n    Tally-Revision: sha256:152cd533e13f9f9491d2324dd3c370edf7ab76bdfafce33c2195a0fd4ef9488f\n\n tests/RECONCILE-instruments-2026-08-30.md | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 1 file changed, 91 insertions(+)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2b26b9f-158c-448d-82e5-82ef18d3e88a","uuid":"594a134c-2541-4c90-8ecb-b87b3f4bceca","timestamp":"2026-08-30T10:37:34.383Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"--- d446d2b ---\nd446d2b bench: per-arm JIT warmup (ds4-vllm two-request protocol) + MTP intel notes\ncommit d446d2b3f69a35c2eb91fa1ad36f27c2571d1aeb\nAuthor: mecattaf <thomas@mecattaf.dev>\nDate:   Sun Aug 30 12:36:45 2026 +0200\n\n    bench: per-arm JIT warmup (ds4-vllm two-request protocol) + MTP intel notes\n    \n    warmup_arm() after each arm's readiness: a tiny completion compiles the\n    Triton decode/drafter kernels, then one max-depth prefill walks every\n    indexer depth bucket on the way up (ds4-vllm-warmup.py's insight — no\n    per-depth sweep). Without it the first measured load of each cell pays\n    multi-minute JIT stalls. Unique nonce prompt so no measured cell can hit\n    warmup-seeded cache. DAYRUN-NOTES: ds4-vllm deep-dive corrections and\n    transferables (DS4_MTP_STATS/bench driver not published; MoE fast-path\n    bound is n_rows*experts<=64 branch-only; stash contract et al).\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RZLdMFrCnEgtaWKRfxfWWP\n\n bench/run-matrix.sh     | 34 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n handoff/DAYRUN-NOTES.md | 27 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n 2 files changed, 61 insertions(+)\n--- prev rev-4 commit stat ---\ncommit 69053ad9be6ed49c1a0a55483d152899d07a1935\nAuthor: tally spec-build <tally-spec-build@invalid>\nDate:   Sun Aug 30 12:24:54 2026 +0200\n\n    instruments: Engagement-proof instruments adapted into the container overlay (rev 4: carrier for proxy first-light fixes 8669bad)\n    \n    Rejected the lane-tip commit message and used the task-id template instead. Reason: type must be one of build, chore, ci, docs, feat, fix,